### TEACHER-ONLY API TEST SUITE
### Base URL: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/
### Tests for teacher-specific APIs

### ============================================================
### IMPORTANT: TOKEN WORKFLOW FOR TEACHERS
### ============================================================
### 1. First, run the LOGIN request below with a teacher account
### 2. Copy the token value from the response
### 3. Replace @teacher_token with the copied token
### 4. All teacher-specific requests will now work
### ============================================================

### ============================================================
### AUTHENTICATION (For Teachers)
### ============================================================

### 1. Login - POST /auth/login/ (TEACHER ACCOUNT)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### SAVE THE token FROM RESPONSE AND USE BELOW:
@teacher_token = your_token_here

### ============================================================
### TEACHER-SPECIFIC ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================

### 1. Get All Teachers - GET /teachers/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/teachers/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 2. Get Teacher's Assigned Subjects - GET /teachers/{id}/subjects/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/teachers/1/subjects/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### ============================================================
### ATTENDANCE MANAGEMENT (Teacher Can Mark)
### ============================================================

### 1. Mark Attendance for Student - POST /attendance/
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/attendance/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student": 1,
  "subject": 1,
  "date": "2026-01-04",
  "status": true,
  "classes_held": 10,
  "classes_attended": 8,
  "marked_by": 1
}

### 2. View Attendance Records - GET /attendance/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/attendance/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 3. View Student's Attendance - GET /attendance/?student_id=1
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/attendance/?student_id=1
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### ============================================================
### MARKS & GRADES MANAGEMENT
### ============================================================

### 1. Add Marks for Student - POST /marks/
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/marks/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student": 1,
  "subject": 1,
  "internal_marks": 35,
  "semester_marks": 65
}

### 2. View All Marks - GET /marks/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/marks/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 3. Get Specific Mark Entry - GET /marks/{id}/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/marks/1/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 4. Update Marks - PUT /marks/{id}/
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/marks/1/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "internal_marks": 40,
  "semester_marks": 70
}

### 5. Delete Marks - DELETE /marks/{id}/
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/marks/1/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 6. View Student Marks - GET /marks/by_student/?student_id=1
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/marks/by_student/?student_id=1
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 7. View Subject Marks - GET /marks/by_subject/?subject_id=1
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/marks/by_subject/?subject_id=1
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### ============================================================
### NOTIFICATION/ANNOUNCEMENT (TEACHER SPECIFIC)
### ============================================================

### 1. Send Announcement to Specific Student - POST /notifications/send-announcement/
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/notifications/send-announcement/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target_type": "student",
  "target_id": 1,
  "title": "Assignment Due",
  "message": "Your Data Structures assignment is due by January 10, 2026."
}

### 2. Send Announcement to Entire Class - POST /notifications/send-announcement/
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/notifications/send-announcement/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target_type": "class",
  "target_id": 1,
  "title": "Class Notice",
  "message": "Tomorrow's lecture is rescheduled to 3 PM."
}

### 3. View Sent Notifications - GET /notifications/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/notifications/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 4. Get Notification Details - GET /notifications/{id}/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/notifications/1/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 5. Mark Notification as Read - PUT /notifications/{id}/mark_read/
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/notifications/1/mark_read/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### ============================================================
### FACULTY & ACADEMIC STRUCTURE (READ-ONLY)
### ============================================================

### 1. View All Departments - GET /departments/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/departments/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 2. View All Courses - GET /courses/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/courses/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 3. View All Subjects - GET /subjects/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/subjects/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 4. View All Classes - GET /classes/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/classes/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### ============================================================
### STUDENT INFORMATION (READ-ONLY)
### ============================================================

### 1. View All Students - GET /students/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/students/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 2. Get Student Details - GET /students/{id}/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/students/1/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 3. Get Student Attendance - GET /students/{id}/attendance/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/students/1/attendance/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 4. Get Student Marks - GET /students/{id}/marks/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/students/1/marks/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### ============================================================
### PROFILE MANAGEMENT (COMMON ENDPOINTS)
### ============================================================

### 1. Get Your Profile - GET /auth/profile/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/profile/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### 2. Update Your Profile - PUT /auth/profile/
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/profile/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "address": "123 Main St"
}

### 3. Change Password - POST /auth/change-password/
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/change-password/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "oldpassword123",
  "new_password": "newpassword456",
  "confirm_password": "newpassword456"
}

### 4. Logout - POST /auth/logout/
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/logout/
Authorization: Token @teacher_token

### ============================================================
### QUICK REFERENCE - TEACHER API SUMMARY
### ============================================================

### TEACHER ACTIONS
### POST   /notifications/send-announcement/    - Send announcement to student/class
### POST   /attendance/                         - Mark student attendance
### POST   /marks/                              - Add student marks
### PUT    /marks/{id}/                         - Update student marks
### DELETE /marks/{id}/                         - Delete mark entry

### TEACHER VIEW ACCESS
### GET    /teachers/                           - View all teachers
### GET    /teachers/{id}/subjects/             - View assigned subjects
### GET    /attendance/                         - View attendance records
### GET    /marks/                              - View all marks
### GET    /students/                           - View all students
### GET    /students/{id}/                      - View student details
### GET    /students/{id}/attendance/           - View student attendance
### GET    /students/{id}/marks/                - View student marks
### GET    /notifications/                      - View sent notifications
### GET    /departments/                        - View all departments
### GET    /courses/                            - View all courses
### GET    /subjects/                           - View all subjects
### GET    /classes/                            - View all classes

### COMMON AUTHENTICATION
### GET    /auth/profile/                       - Get your profile
### PUT    /auth/profile/                       - Update your profile
### POST   /auth/change-password/               - Change password
### POST   /auth/logout/                        - Logout

### ============================================================
### NOTES:
### - Replace @teacher_token with actual authentication token
### - Replace {id} with actual resource ID
### - Teachers can only modify marks/attendance for their subjects
### - Announcements sent to classes reach all enrolled students
### - All times are in UTC/ISO 8601 format
### ============================================================
